{"id":"wb-3-107","name":"天台庵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天台庵","text":"天台庵，位于中华人民共和国山西省平顺县北耽车乡王曲村西部的高地上，是一座佛教天台宗庵堂，始建于唐代。天台庵长期被断定为唐天祐四年（907年）建筑，并与五台山南禅寺大殿、佛光寺东大殿和芮城广仁王庙正殿并称中国现存“四大唐代木构建筑”。2014年修缮过程中发现后唐天成、长兴年间墨书题记后，其主体建筑年代重新被推定为五代后唐时期。1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E5%8F%B0%E5%BA%B5","revisionId":94906048,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94906048","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/702ae7b744ac943520cb1cc5.jpg","title":"20260405_Tiantai_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260405_Tiantai_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0a/20260405_Tiantai_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​平顺 天台庵","width":320,"height":213}}